    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "In Model 1, the predicted change in the denial probability when `pirat` increases from $0.3$ to $0.4$ can be computed as\n",
        "$$\n",
        " \\begin{align*}\n",
        " &\\Delta \\hat{P}({\\tt deny}=1|{\\tt pirat})\\\\\n",
        " &=\\Phi\\left(-2.194+2.968\\times 0.4\\right)- \\Phi\\left(-2.194+2.968\\times 0.3\\right)\\approx0.060.\n",
        " \\end{align*}\n",
        "$$"
      ],
      "id": "1e1edb1d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
