    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Using Model 2, for a white and a black applicant with `pirat = 0.3`, we compute the predicted denial probabilities as follows:\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\begin{align*}\n",
        "&\\hat{P}({\\tt deny}=1|{\\tt pirat}=0.3,{\\tt black}=0)=\\Phi\\left(-2.259+2.742\\times0.3+0.708\\times0\\right)\\approx0.075,\\\\\n",
        "&\\hat{P}({\\tt deny}=1|{\\tt pirat}=0.3,{\\tt black}=1)=\\Phi\\left(-2.259+2.742\\times0.3+0.708\\times1\\right)\\approx0.233.\n",
        "\\end{align*}\n",
        "$$"
      ],
      "id": "c50a6f36"
    },
